              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To like sin is to like making trouble. If you brag all the time,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17.19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "brag",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "time",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "make a show of your wealth.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " you are asking for trouble.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyone who thinks and speaks evil can expect to find nothing good — only disaster.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There is nothing but sadness and sorrow for parents whose children do foolish things.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Being cheerful keeps you healthy. It is slow death to be gloomy all the time.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Corrupt judges accept secret bribes, and then justice is not done.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An intelligent person aims at wise action, but a fool starts off in many directions.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Foolish children bring grief to their fathers and bitter regrets to their mothers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is not right to make an innocent person pay a fine; justice is perverted when good people are punished.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Those who are sure of themselves do not talk all the time. People who stay calm have real insight. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After all, even a fool may be thought wise and intelligent if he stays quiet and keeps his mouth shut.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.17.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
